docs {
  # Send Test Slack Notifier
  
  Queues a `ping` notifier through the configured Slack incoming webhook.
  
  **Method:** POST  
  **Endpoint:** `{{base_url}}/settings/project/integrations/slack-notifier-test`  
  **Route name:** `project.integrations.slack-notifier-test`  
  **Permission:** `CanManageProjectSettings`
  
  Requires `notifier_slack_webhook_url` under Integrations. Deprecated alias: `POST /settings/project/slack-notifier-test`.
}
